{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18205080","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18205080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1820508001:1":{"text":"저기 멀리 있는 곳이 괜찮겠어! 주변에 수풀이 우거져 있는데다, 큰 바위들도 많아서 사각지대를 만들기 쉽거든. 매복하기... 아니, 장난을 준비하기에 딱 좋아.","source_cn":"远处那块地段比较合适！周围树丛茂密，巨石的分布容易形成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FA20911AEEB5A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1820508002:1":{"text":"좋아요! 그럼 가는 길에 재료를 찾고, 적당한 곳에 미리 “호박 유령”을 만들어 두자고요.","source_cn":"听你的！我们沿路寻找素材，再找块地方提前做好“南瓜幽灵”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D9959E928A0F64B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1820508003:1":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 여기엔 호박보다 무서운 게 분명 잔뜩 있을 테니까, 틀림없이 쓸 만한 걸 찾을 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"放心吧，这里肯定有许多比南瓜还恐怖的东西，肯定能派上用场！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45CE7C4991FC2E34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:爱丝特瑞达":{"text":"에스트릴다","source":"爱丝特瑞达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:里纳":{"text":"레인","source":"里纳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}